{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-def-12","kind":"definition","title":"第二类截差无理线段","englishTitle":"But if the annex be commensurable in length with the rational straight line set out, and the square on the whole be greater than that on the annex by the square on a straight line commensurable with the whole, let the apotome be called a second apotome.","book":10,"number":12,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.def_3.2","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.def_3.2/","group":"def_3","sourceNumber":2,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":false,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-def-12@raw-2e67397b04912b6e","contentId":"euclid-10-def-12","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2e67397b04912b6e8d6130edc5815aa147c5dba7e075b8deb174c55514d93eab","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-def-12.statement","euclid-10-def-12.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-def-12.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-def-12","revisionId":"euclid-10-def-12@raw-2e67397b04912b6e","order":0,"kind":"definition","title":"定义陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc8e71c14149d1cd84b671a6f06d00735b149f00f827045ec4f20cc3d3d3a1b0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But if the annex be commensurable in length with the rational straight line set out, and the square on the whole be greater than that on the annex by the square on a straight line commensurable with the whole, let the apotome be called a second apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果附件为长度可公度,有理线段是列出的,而正方形是整个正方形,则整个可公度直线比附件的正方形大于截差无理线段,那么,截差无理线段就称为第二个截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-def-12.source","contentId":"euclid-10-def-12","revisionId":"euclid-10-def-12@raw-2e67397b04912b6e","order":1,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f2a1beffe5a5581591872fec372450b272b6d7cf3736ae71a302ae14c2ce9c55","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.def_3.2/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.def_3.2\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-86:euclid-10-def-12:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-86","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-86.proof.11"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-def-12","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.86","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.86/","sourceLabel":"X. Deff. III. 2"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-92:euclid-10-def-12:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-92","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-92.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-def-12","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.92","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.92/","sourceLabel":"X. Deff. III. 2"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-98:euclid-10-def-12:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-98","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-98.proof.13"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-def-12","t